Package: cortisol.nmea
Title: Nonlinear Mixed-Effects Modeling and Simulation for Cortisol Curves
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xing", "Qiu", email = "xing_qiu@urmc.rochester.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yu", "Gu", role = "aut"),
    person("Yuntian", "Meng", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Tools for fitting interpretable nonlinear mixed-effects models
    to diurnal cortisol curves and for running synthetic simulation benchmarks
    under sparse sampling, heteroscedastic noise, missingness, and contamination.
